bol of Ravenkind is a unique holy symbol sacred to the good-hearted faithful of Barovia.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816211253\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.175 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19197/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4534/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n160.63%  256.467     39 Template:IO\n100.00%  159.667      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  159.667      1 -total\n 97.01%  154.899      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 54.42%   86.885      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 53.52%   85.459      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 52.35%   83.586      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 51.22%   81.777      2 Template:InCategory\n 16.29%   26.009      1 Template:Mat\n 15.66%   24.997      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:66460-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816211253 and revision id 631464. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
